<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Glass says 12-mth net 26 pct down.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Glass says 12-mth net 26 pct down.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	   (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1997		1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	    638.67   vs     655.44</p>
<p>    Net profit	   64.47   vs	87.23</p>
<p>    Tax		     --     vs	  --</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Ceylon Glass Co Ltd is Sri Lanka's main manufacturer of glass packing containers and bottles.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
